  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Donations received from 1st Sept &apos;22 will provide additional support to some students in critical need.  Education is essential in empowering young people from tea estate communities in Sri Lanka to expand their career prospects, realise their potential and help lift their families out of extreme poverty. Our Tea Leaf Centres provide young people between the ages of 18 and 26 years old with free professional development and vocational training centres.</narrative>
  </description>
